{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/341665-buffy-the-vampire-slayer","id":341665,"title":"Buffy the vampire slayer","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-12-16T02:52:25-08:00","id":341665,"title":"Buffy the vampire slayer","content":"So I know this is a silly topic but I loved the show and was thinking about what it is exactly that made her &quot;superhuman &quot; and capable of going toe to toe with blood suckers. <br /> <br /> I'd like to use second ed (gmc) rules to stat her (and possibly the rest of the cast)<br /> <br /> I was thinking about second sight biokinesis possibly being something she has. As well as unseen sight (sense vampire) and a few reflex speed merits. <br /> <br /> The only issue I have with second ed biokinesis is that it moves dots instead of adding (she was stronger overall she didnt trade stamina for strength) and the fact it won't go past six dots. Let's face it her reflexes were ridiculous she could catch an arrow or thrown knife at her head with ease. <br /> <br /> What do you guys think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3837-slimjimjohnson","name":"Slimjimjohnson","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T06:00:48-08:00","id":341816,"title":"","content":"Ok first of all it's not silly I think it's a good source of inspiration for hunter. Second here are the powers of the Slayer <a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slayer_(Buffy_the_Vampire_Slayer\" target=\"_blank\">http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Slayer_...Vampire_Slayer</a>) And here is a list of merits <a href=\"http://wodindex.wikispaces.com/Merits\" target=\"_blank\">http://wodindex.wikispaces.com/Merits</a>. As far as I can see the slayer condition boosts your attributes more than anything else. Many of it's abilities are easily represented with merits. Specifically I'm thinking of these:<br /> Mental merits: Danger sense, Eye for the strange, enhanced senses (+2 to perception rolls) Fast Reflexes and Indomitable. (maybe if she is very experienced: tolerance for biology and trained observer.)<br /> Physical merits: Ambidextrous, Fleet of foot, Hardy, Iron stamina, quick healer, iron stomach, natural immunity, strong back, parkour and quick draw.<br /> Social merits: Allies, contacts, mentor, iron will, inspiring, small unit tactics.<br /> Supernatural merits: Omen sensitivity, Unseen sense.<br /> Fighting merits: Depends on her training but I would mostly go with martial arts and a bit of other styles.<br /> I know they look like a lot of advantages but remember that we are trying to create a human being that can go toe to toe with a vampire. As for the superhuman attributes I would create a merit called mark of the slayer instead of using biokinesis. It basically imbues the hunter with the slayer condition raising her physical attributes to 6, with the possibility of raising them higher. She has no control of her physical power, it simply increases past human levels and stays there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2964,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","user":"Firanai","date":". 12-16-2014, 09:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2964-firanai","name":"Firanai","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2964_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T09:14:11-08:00","id":341993,"title":"","content":"Another thing is to make it a Style type Merit. That reflects how Buffy was able to take on bigger and badder things as the series went on rather than to have her buy different merits.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T11:13:50-08:00","id":342093,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I'd actually make her some description of Slasher.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-12-16T19:13:02-08:00","id":342489,"title":"","content":"Since the lucifuge are demonic and when one dies another one is called, I'd make Buffy a lucifuge: unholy attributes, a healing power, enhanced brawl and melee, merits for everything else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":391,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","user":"StSword","date":". 12-16-2014, 10:17 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"ke